What is Decorator Design Pattern ?

The Decorator Design Pattern is used when we want to add new Features/behavior without modifying the existing
Class.

In Decorator we Dynamically add Features/behavior to object


Why do we need Decorator Design Pattern ?
Without Decorator suppose, i Have Pizza and i want extra cheese or Vegies on It.
i will create new Class with CheesePizza or VegiesPizza or CheeseVegiesPizza, this will lead to multiple
classes (over Crowding)

With Decorator what we Does we Wrap the base class with the decorator

The Decorator has both is-a and has-a relationship


Example of Decorator

interface Coffee{
    int getCost();
}

class Caphecino implements Coffee{
    int getCost(){return 100}
}

interface Decorator extends Coffee{

}

class ExtraSugar implements Decorator{
    Coffee coffee;
    public ExtraSugar(Coffee coffee){
    this.coffee = coffee;
    }

    int getCost(){
        coffee.getCost + 20;
    }
}


